\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Fight the good fight with all thy might;
\par Christ is thy strength, and Christ thy right;
\par Lay hold on life, and it shall be
\par Thy joy and crown eternally.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Run the straight race through God's good grace;
\par Lift up thine eyes, and seek His face,
\par Life with its path before thee lies;
\par Christ is the way, and Christ the prize.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Cast care aside, lean on thy Guide,
\par His boundless mercy will provide;
\par Lean, and thy trusting soul shall prove,
\par Christ is thy life, and Christ thy love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Faint not, nor fear, His arm is near;
\par He changeth not, and thou art dear,
\par Only believe, and thou shalt see
\par That Christ is all in all to thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

